<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/normal_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Congrats Sony on another lost customer &nbsp;(Read 433 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=223" title="View the profile of Heloisa">Heloisa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 104<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://members.shaw.ca/petethecanuk/Electravatar5.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Got Box?<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=223"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=650.msg5572#msg5572"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=650.msg5572#msg5572">Congrats Sony on another lost customer</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> February 18, 2004, 10:53:21 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							A big <b><font size="2">FUCK YOU</font></b> to Sony for their lastest blunder.<br /><br />Yes you guessed it, the Tribute system nerf.<br /><br />Yeah I rushed out and cleared my mule and all my characters inventories of old junk for turn ins. It was great! Felt like spring cleaning my garage! hehe<br /><br />I had 175,000 points accumlated through &quot;honest&quot; turn ins.. ie) no exploits such as that tinkering thingy.<br /><br />My &quot;adjusted&quot; total is now a touch over 71K for a net loss of 104,000 points. I got fucked hardcore up the ass and SoE didn&#039;t even kiss me! Sucks even worse for those with higher totals gathered through honest means. =(<br /><br />My question is, they (SoE) surely must have known the tribute system was &quot;unbalanced&quot;, if so, why implement it in the first place? By &quot;resetting&quot; the tribute system they have pissed off thousands of customers including me.<br /><br />Businesses accross the world are held to higher standards then this. If an ad comes out for a product that is mispriced (happens all the time) , the company must honour that price. Sure they&#039;ll retract the ad and fix the problem, but they don&#039;t go out with the nerfbat whacking those who already bought the item.<br /><br />I&#039;m glad the system is &quot;fixed&quot;, what I&#039;m pissed about is the system never should have been implemented in the first place considering how unbalanced it was.<br /><br />This will definately be the last expansion I ever purchase from SoE for EQlive.<br /><br /><br />Fuck you Sony<br /><br /><i>You may now resume your normal daily activities</i><br /><br />cheers &nbsp;;D
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />AFK[65 Archon]<b> <a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1015600" target="_blank"><span style="color: blue;">Heloisa</span></a> </b>(Wood Elf) &lt;Fires of Time&gt;<br />Servant of Tunare Babe
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg5578"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=167" title="View the profile of Wyztyz">Wyztyz</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 41<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://forums.gucomics.com/images/avatars/20002703583fbef1af3a4d3.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=265105278" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=265105278&amp;img=5" alt="265105278" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/Wyztyz" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=Wyztyz"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=Wyztyz&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=Wyztyz&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=167"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.dragonsfist.org" title="Dragons Fist" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:wyztyz@aol.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=650.msg5578#msg5578"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=650.msg5578#msg5578">Re:Congrats Sony on another lost customer</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> February 18, 2004, 02:07:56 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Tell us how you really feel. &nbsp; :D <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Heloisa link=board=10;threadid=650;start=0#msg5572 date=1077119601</div><div class="quote">Businesses accross the world are held to higher standards then this. If an ad comes out for a product that is mispriced (happens all the time) , the company must honour that price. Sure they&#039;ll retract the ad and fix the problem, but they don&#039;t go out with the nerfbat whacking those who already bought the item.<br /></div><br />I agree that SoE should honor their own mistake. &nbsp; Heloisa, &nbsp;I hope getting it off your chest made you feel a little better. &nbsp;
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: February 18, 2004, 02:10:08 pm by Wyztyz</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Wyztyz Wyckedwytz<br />Wizardess of the Solusek Ro and the 65th Season<br />Broodmother and Guild Leader to Dragons Fist on Rodcet Nife<br />RL &gt; EQ. &nbsp;Keep it in perspective!
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg5579"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 214<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=650.msg5579#msg5579"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=650.msg5579#msg5579">Re:Congrats Sony on another lost customer</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> February 18, 2004, 02:24:33 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							yeah, it sucks. &nbsp;As usual when Sony screwed up and had to nerf something, they nerfed way too hard. &nbsp;<br /><br />I do wonder how they&#039;d decide what was exploiting and what wasn&#039;t. &nbsp;There were clear cut things like my 500 or so animated baits netting about 600k tribute points. :D &nbsp;But then there was other stupid stuff like fine steel weapons paying about 1k each, or their equivalents such as luggald daggers from nadox being worth 1100 each. &nbsp;Those had to be nerfed, but how much is fair? &nbsp;I think a lot of things got nerfed too much and yeah, they should be more careful about taking away points we already had.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg5584"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269" title="View the profile of Ssnakess">Ssnakess</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Gecko not Geico<br />
								Global Moderator<br />
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 217<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/kof1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								die plz<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.ascentguild.com" title="Ascent Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Ssnakess@mail2hell.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=650.msg5584#msg5584"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=650.msg5584#msg5584">Re:Congrats Sony on another lost customer</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> February 18, 2004, 07:29:30 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I lost about 50,000 points myself. &nbsp;Didn&#039;t really expect them to do it, even though it was in the last patch message that they were looking at it.<br /><br />It&#039;s such a bullshit move to alter peoples current point values that were caused by your own mistake. &nbsp;They really should return the values to where they were, and simply accept the totals because of their own fuck up.<br /><br />Nothing we can really do about it of course.<br /><br />Thank you SoE for stealing my points &lt;3
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
