							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							/conspiricy mode on<br />The casino was a ploy to get cash out of the game and the tribute system was a ploy to get items out of the game. <br />They knew what they were doing and pulled it off well<br />/conspiricy mode off<br /><br />Btw: i r gud speller
