							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							To add to the conspiracy... as with all prior expansions, some kind of upgrade is way too easy to get when it first comes out. &nbsp;This is to sell the expansion. &nbsp;Then once people have bought the damn thing, the stupidly easy to get power is nerfed out of it.
